# Physical reconciliation rules

## Intent lifecycle

`PLANNED → READY → MATERIALIZING → MATERIALIZED`
Also: `BLOCKED`, `FAILED_RETRYABLE` (bounded retries), `FAILED_TERMINAL`, `SUPERSEDED`, `REMOVED`

Status is explicit on the intent record — never infer from missing map entries.

## Realization constraints

- Chunk-local slices; intent stays pending while destination chunks unloaded
- No force-load of large areas
- Bounded ops per server tick (`maxReconciliationOpsPerTick`)
- Idempotent: completed intents must not re-materialize after restart
- Failures log intentId/type/settlement/chunk/reason/retryCount — no per-block spam

## Provenance

`BlockProvenance`: LIVINGMODS_ORIGINAL, LIVINGMODS_DYNAMIC, VANILLA_NATURAL, FOREIGN_MOD, PLAYER_MODIFIED, UNKNOWN_PROTECTED

Unknown/protected → plan around, replan, or block intent. Never destructive overwrite.

## Outcomes

Use `PhysicalOutcomePayload` / `PhysicalOutcomeType`. Sidecar applies via `PhysicalOutcomeApplier`.
Client reputation deltas and arbitrary task completion are not authoritative.

## Construction flow

population/housing/profession/security/war damage
→ ConstructionEngine reserves stockpile resources + labour check
→ PhysicalIntent READY
→ PhysicalReconciliationEngine materializes with BuildingMaterializer
→ INTENT_MATERIALIZED outcome
→ housingUnits / physicalCapacity / DynamicStructureRecord updated
